    "detailed_description": "<strong>The world doesn't need heroe anymore, humans and demons live together &quot;peacefully&quot; under the framework of the &quot;law&quot; ...... In the face of such falsehood and hypocrisy, a rogue has no ability to fight back, and &quot;justice&quot; can only be buried in one's heart?<br><br>Open world: Explore cities and labyrinths, discover stories, and find all kinds of weapons.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/a1233167293e8f91e4bf94f5f17cac68.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/38f4459a122f0ee00f6ba4e85f146adf.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Recruitment: Solve their problems, get to know their hearts, and let them join your camp!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/359311d192d679863f6a54066652311f.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Equipment and Skills: Configure the right equipment to use the right skills, different combinations will be the key to win or lose the battle.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/98afbe3624ce7179a183302adb1f3653.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>The daily life of an adventurer: without money you have to go on quests!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/d69b44770b173065a3c4e5268202dc28.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span><br><br><strong>Arena: Improve your personal abilities by fighting!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742580/extras/7fd0118ac12fca4ba822f6690d15dc28.avif?t=1706069059\" width=468 height=346 /></span>",
